---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Edubuzz" description="Edubuzz privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information." canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href}>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Last updated: May 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Edubuzz ("we", "us", "our") operates edubuzz.co.za. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA), 2013.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Edubuzz is an information website. When you use the contact form, we collect the name and email address you provide so we can reply. We also collect anonymous usage data via standard analytics tools (Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity). We do not currently collect CVs, applications or employer account data on the public site.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">How we use your information</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li>To respond to messages you send us</li>
      <li>To improve our website and content</li>
      <li>To understand how visitors use the site via analytics</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations under South African law</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Data sharing</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with service providers that help us operate the site (for example, analytics providers), and only as needed for those services.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use cookies and similar technologies for essential site functionality and analytics. We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> and <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> to understand how visitors use the site. We do not currently display advertising or use advertising cookies. For full details, see our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Data retention</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Contact form messages are retained for up to 12 months so we can handle follow-ups, after which they are deleted. Analytics data is retained in aggregated form.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Under POPIA, you have the right to: access your personal data, request correction of inaccurate data, request deletion of your data, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Security</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We implement reasonable security measures to protect your data. All data is transmitted over HTTPS and passwords are stored using industry-standard hashing.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For privacy-related queries, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
